   ],
   "voice": "granny"
  },
  {
   "directed": "Now this is a beautiful continuation.",
   "maps_to": [
    "s71-b6"
   ],
   "voice": "granny"
  },
  {
   "directed": "And the Sanskrit is intentionally dependent upon the previous sūtra.",
   "maps_to": [
    "s71-b7"
   ],
   "voice": "granny"
  },
  {
   "directed": "In other words, the phrase:",
   "maps_to": [
    "s71-b8"
   ],
   "voice": "granny"
  },
  {
   "directed": "continues to govern the meaning.",
   "maps_to": [
    "s71-b10"
   ],
   "voice": "granny"
  },
  {
   "directed": "The fourth should enliven the three states.",
   "maps_to": [
    "s71-b11"
   ],
   "voice": "granny"
  },
  {
